{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-10-06 10:00:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS TO INVEST ABOUT $500 MILLION TO BUILD GREEN HYDROGEN PRODUCTION FACILITY IN NEW YORK', 'text': '94-MEGAWATT HYDROELECTRIC POWER ALLOCATION ALREADY APPROVED LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , OCT. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD),\xa0THE WORLD LEADER IN HYDROGEN PRODUCTION AND A FIRST MOVER DEVELOPING AND EXECUTING LOW CARBON HYDROGEN MEGAPROJECTS DRIVING THE ENERGY TRANSITION, TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO INVEST APPROXIMATELY $500 MILLION TO BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE A 35 METRIC TON PER DAY FACILITY TO PRODUCE GREEN LIQUID HYDROGEN AT A GREENFIELD SITE IN MASSENA, NEW YORK, AS WELL AS LIQUID HYDROGEN DISTRIBUTION AND DISPENSING OPERATIONS.'}